        "raw": "<p>I&#39;ve been ruling that it did. It triggers off of entering a hex, or ending your turn on the hex. Being placed on the map is entering the hex just the same as moving onto the hex is. In my games so far, it&#39;s only been in the case of Drone Deployment onto Impaling Structures, but it should apply the same way.</p>",
